@startuml A1_4_tool_fsm
title Figma Sketch · C1 · Состояния инструментов
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
[*] --> Select
state Select {
 [*] --> IdleSelect
 IdleSelect --> ObjectSelected : click object
 ObjectSelected --> IdleSelect : click empty / Esc
 ObjectSelected --> DragSelection : drag selected object
 DragSelection --> ObjectSelected : pointer up / commit
}
Select --> ShapeMenu : выбрать Shape
ShapeMenu --> Shape : выбрать тип фигуры
Shape --> Shape : drag / update preview
Shape --> Select : pointer up / commit
Shape --> Select : Esc / cancel
Select --> Pen : выбрать Pen
Pen --> Pen : click / add anchor node
Pen --> Pen : drag / set Bezier handles
Pen --> Select : Enter / double-click / close first node
Pen --> Select : Esc / cancel unfinished path
Select --> Brush : выбрать Brush
Brush --> Brush : pointer move / append stroke points
Brush --> Select : pointer up / commit stroke
Select --> Comments : выбрать Comments
Comments --> Comments : click canvas / object anchor
Comments --> Select : Esc / exit comments
Select --> ImageInsert : drag image onto canvas
ImageInsert --> Select : asset loaded / insert selected image
ImageInsert --> Select : cancel
Select --> Crop : enter crop mode
Crop --> Crop : drag crop bounds
Crop --> Select : commit crop / leave crop mode
Crop --> Select : Esc / cancel crop
Select --> Pan : Space + drag / pan canvas
Shape --> Pan : Space + drag
Pen --> Pan : Space + drag
Brush --> Pan : Space + drag
Comments --> Pan : Space + drag
Pan --> Select : release Space
note right of ShapeMenu
 Shape menu contains basic vector shapes.
 Shape creation starts on pointer down
 and commits on pointer up.
end note
note right of ImageInsert
 Image can be imported by drag-and-drop.
 After insertion it is selected and editable.
end note
note bottom of Comments
 Comment thread and replies are owned by C4.
 C1 manages the anchor to an object or canvas point.
end note
note bottom of Pan
 Pan is temporary canvas navigation;
 it returns to the previously active tool.
end note
@enduml
